<title>POLAND: STOMIL SANOK JAN NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL SANOK JAN NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.26 vs   0.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.26 vs   0.21</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.94 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Sales		   11.62 vs   9.55</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish rubber products maker is</p>
<p>Sanockie Zaklady Przemyslu Gumowego Stomil Sanok SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
